Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.40-rt60 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.40 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  Head SHA1: fe87e212a08cfe30c36bb46d779a6fb21c6b76b8


Or to build 3.2.40-rt60 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.40.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.40-rt60.patch.xz



Enjoy,

-- Steve



